   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2023-02-06",
   "text": "Help Ensure Lower Patient Copays Act or the HELP Copays Act\n This bill requires health insurance plans to apply certain payments made by, or on behalf of, a plan enrollee toward a plan's cost-sharing requirements. Specifically, plans must apply third-party payments, financial assistance, discounts, product vouchers, and other reductions in out-of-pocket expenses toward the requirements."
